# Electrobun skills in this repo

When a task may involve **Electrobun** (desktop shell, webview/renderer, typed RPC, `electrobun.config.ts`, `electrobun build` / `dev`, or native app packaging):

1. Open **`.cursor/electrobun-skill-routing.md`** and use its table to choose skills.
2. Load each needed guide with the **Read** tool at  
   **`<repo>/.agents/skills/<skill-id>/SKILL.md`**  
   (replace `<skill-id>` with the slug from the table, e.g. `electrobun-rpc`).  
   If an approved linked skill is missing there, run `mise run link:skills`
   (the approved set is defined in `assets/guides/SKILLS.md`). For global-only
   skills, read from `$HOME/.agents/skills/` or `$HOME/.config/cursor/skills/`.

If nothing matches, read **`electrobun-plugin-guide`** first, then narrow.

Prefer repo guides for **kb-specific** wiring: `assets/guides/ELECTROBUN.md`, `assets/docs/specs/foundation/design.md`.

Do **not** rely on memory alone for Electrobun APIs when a skill covers the topic—read the skill, then implement.
